 [:db/add "552f7559-74ed-50e1-8505-9c756f346ad2" :answer-field/choices "d59ec5fa-9d13-5fc4-8c6d-4334df2e5574"] [:db/add "552f7559-74ed-50e1-8505-9c756f346ad2" :answer-field/correct "f9763a24-d037-571b-9f03-46dc3f319384"] [:db/ensure "552f7559-74ed-50e1-8505-9c756f346ad2" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "95870580-b5cf-5914-9a93-1e8255bc81ca" :question/id #uuid "95870580-b5cf-5914-9a93-1e8255bc81ca"] [:db/add "95870580-b5cf-5914-9a93-1e8255bc81ca" :question/problem "Which of the following first-order linear differential equations are homogeneous?\n\nSelect all that apply."] [:db/add "95870580-b5cf-5914-9a93-1e8255bc81ca" :question/worked-solution "A first-order linear differential equation is homogeneous if it can be written in the form\n\n$$\n{y}^{′}+P(x)y=0.\n$$\n\nNow, let's consider each equation in turn.\n\n- First, we consider the equation\n\n$$\n{y}^{′}+8{x}^{3}y=4y.\n$$\n\nWe move the term involving $y$ to the left side so that all $y$-terms are together:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{y}^{′}+8{x}^{3}y & =4y \\\\ {y}^{′}+8{x}^{3}y-4y & =0 \\\\ {y}^{′}+(8{x}^{3}-4)y & =0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis matches the homogeneous form ${y}^{′}+P(x)y=0.$ Therefore, this equation is homogeneous.\n\n- Next, we consider the equation\n\n$$\n{y}^{′}+8{x}^{3}y=-5y.\n$$\n\nWe move the term involving $y$ to the left side so that all $y$-terms are together:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{y}^{′}+8{x}^{3}y & =-5y \\\\ {y}^{′}+8{x}^{3}y+5y & =0 \\\\ {y}^{′}+(8{x}^{3}+5)y & =0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis matches the homogeneous form ${y}^{′}+P(x)y=0.$ Therefore, this equation is homogeneous.\n\n- Finally, we consider the equation\n\n$$\n{y}^{′}+8{x}^{3}y=-3.\n$$\n\nThe presence of the constant term $-3$ means the right-hand side is not zero, and so it cannot be rewritten in homogeneous form. Thus, this equation is *not* homogeneous.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is ${y}^{′}+8{x}^{3}y=4y$; ${y}^{′}+8{x}^{3}y=-5y$ only."] [:db/add "95870580-b5cf-5914-9a93-1e8255bc81ca" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "95870580-b5cf-5914-9a93-1e8255bc81ca" :question/answer-fields "d9234d2f-f7ae-5ff4-b1cf-c005b486a2de"] [:db/add "95870580-b5cf-5914-9a93-1e8255bc81ca" :question/answer-fields "bf285f5d-b22c-5312-bf34-858cc56e87cb"] [:db/add "95870580-b5cf-5914-9a93-1e8255bc81ca" :question/answer-fields "552f7559-74ed-50e1-8505-9c756f346ad2"] [:db/ensure "95870580-b5cf-5914-9a93-1e8255bc81ca" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186087868 :knowledge-point/questions "95870580-b5cf-5914-9a93-1e8255bc81ca"] [:db/add "1a45a63b-566f-5c4c-940b-0a8f8df66a60" :answer/id #uuid "1a45a63b-566f-5c4c-940b-0a8f8df66a60"] [:db/add "1a45a63b-566f-5c4c-940b-0a8f8df66a60" :answer/type :answer.type/text] [:db/add "1a45a63b-566f-5c4c-940b-0a8f8df66a60" :answer/value "false"] [:db/ensure "1a45a63b-566f-5c4c-940b-0a8f8df66a60" :answer/validate] [:db/add "2d6fd131-4d4b-5c1d-87bc-fd9d9eee9504" :answer/id #uuid "2d6fd131-4d4b-5c1d-87bc-fd9d9eee9504"] [:db/add "2d6fd131-4d4b-5c1d-87bc-fd9d9eee9504" :answer/type :answer.type/text] [:db/add "2d6fd131-4d4b-5c1d-87bc-fd9d9eee9504" :answer/value "true"] [:db/ensure "2d6fd131-4d4b-5c1d-87bc-fd9d9eee9504" :answer/validate] [:db/add "df3928d3-9553-5b66-b88b-336095f3c563" :answer-field/id #uuid "df3928d3-9553-5b66-b88b-336095f3c563"] [:db/add "df3928d3-9553-5b66-b88b-336095f3c563" :answer-field/key "${y}^{′}+4xy=2y$"] [:db/add "df3928d3-9553-5b66-b88b-336095f3c563" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/checkbox] [:db/add "df3928d3-9553-5b66-b88b-336095f3c563" :answer-field/choices "1a45a63b-566f-5c4c-940b-0a8f8df66a60"] [:db/add "df3928d3-9553-5b66-b88b-336095f3c563" :answer-field/choices "2d6fd131-4d4b-5c1d-87bc-fd9d9eee9504"] [:db/add "df3928d3-9553-5b66-b88b-336095f3c563" :answer-field/correct "2d6fd131-4d4b-5c1d-87bc-fd9d9eee9504"] [:db/ensure "df3928d3-9553-5b66-b88b-336095f3c563" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "c12ed845-7c03-5f67-804f-523fa748afa3" :answer/id #uuid "c12ed845-7c03-5f67-804f-523fa748afa3"] [:db/add "c12ed845-7c03-5f67-80